      "sentence_id": 1,
      "japanese": "私は子どものころ、家族と一緒に一階の家に住んでいた。",
      "english_translation": "When I was young, my family and I lived in a single-story house."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "そのため、窓の外を人が通るのは普通だった。",
      "english_translation": "Therefore, it was normal for people to pass by outside the windows."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "大学に入ると、一人暮らしを始めた。",
      "english_translation": "When I went to university, I started living alone."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "学校の近くのアパートに引っ越したばかりで、まだ新しい生活に慣れていなかった。",
      "english_translation": "I had just moved into an apartment near my school, and I was still getting used to my new life."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "その日の夜、私はレポートを書いていた。",
      "english_translation": "That night, I was working on my report."
    }
